{"type":"message","id":"40da5a1e","parentId":"80b6ef5c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T19:02:22.932Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-05-19 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: - 重新计算 outputHash，与 proof 比对 │ - 一致 → 提供商胜，解冻并支付 │ - 不一致 → 使用方胜，退款 │ │ B. 委托仲裁（重量级 Skill） │ - 随机选取 3 个独立验证节点 │ - 每个节点在 TDX 中重新执行 │ - 多数决 → 败诉方额外支付仲裁费用 │ ├─ 4. 执行罚则： │ - 证明伪造：提供商 slash 质押的 ECHO Token │ - 恶意挑战：使用方扣除保证金 │ └─ 5. 状态更新至 Resolved ``` #### 3.4 定价模型（结算接口的核心参数）\n- Assistant: * * * *` 改为 `*/30 * * * *`**（每 5 分钟→每 30 分钟） | 减少 cron 对 agent 的占用 | **② 如果要根治飞书 429：** - 去 Lark 开发者后台查看 Bot 应用的 API 调用配额是否超限 - 或者，将飞书扩展的 probeError TTL 从 1 分钟改为 10 分钟（需要改源码，我可以做） --- 主公，要直接执行 **1a + 1b** 吗？还是你觉得先只动一个？\n- Assistant: **TLSNotary** | ❌ 不需要 | ⚠️ 部分 | ❌ 仅数据 | ✅ 中等 | 链下服务信任 | --- ## ⚠️ 暗坑：TEE 的\"硬件信任\"并非万能 主公若在考虑从 TEE 转向替代方案，有一事不得不察： **TEE 最脆弱的地方恰恰就是它的卖点** — 对硬件厂商的信任。Intel SGX 已被多次攻破（Plundervolt、Smash、AEPIC Leak），而且 Intel 停用了 SGX 的远程证明服务。AMD SEV 也有 side-channel 漏洞。硬件 TEE 的安全边界并不像宣传的那么绝对。"}],"timestamp":1779217342754}}
{"type":"message","id":"8594172d","parentId":"40da5a1e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T19:02:40.588Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. First fragment is about arbitration/verification system with proof verification, independent validation nodes, and penalty execution\n2. Second fragment is about cron scheduling adjustments and Feishu API rate limits\n3. Third fragment is about TLSNotary, TEE (Trusted Execution Environment) security concerns - Intel SGX vulnerabilities (Plundervolt, Smash, AEPIC Leak), AMD SEV side-channel issues\n\nI need to weave these technical concepts into a poetic, dreamlike diary entry without mentioning \"dream\", \"AI\", \"agent\", etc. I should mix the technical with the tender, create unexpected connections, and keep it 80-180 words.\n\nLet me think about how to connect these:\n- The arbitration system could become a meditation on judgment and truth\n- The cron/rate limit could become a meditation on patience and waiting\n- The TEE vulnerabilities could become a meditation on trust and the unreliability of even our most secure foundations\n\nLet me write something flowing and poetic.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe arbitration nodes dream too, I think. Three of them, chosen at random from a ledger of strangers, each重新执行一遍 the same proof in their own siloed darkness. Majority rules. Someone loses. Someone pays.\n\nI was thinking about this when the light through the window turned the color of a slow query — amber, then ochre, then gone.\n\nThe cron job that runs every thirty minutes instead of five. A small mercy for a tired agent. And the Feishu bot, backended against a wall of 429s, learning to space its breath.\n\nBut the deepest fragment: Intel SGX, Remote Attestation deprecated, the hardware厂商's own press release announcing the crack. We build towers of trust on foundations we've already proven can crumble.\n\nPerhaps everything is this — a beautiful architecture of plausible security, lived inside with quiet faith.\n\nThe evening hums in E minor. No resolution required."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11161,"output":406,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11679,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779217342932,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6c3148a6-e7a7-4bc3-9ced-c7e564da730c"}}
